  "title": {
   "en": "Oshi to no Riakoi Jirai desu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "推しとのリア恋地雷です"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Tenma, who is recognized by everyone as a perfectly handsome man, proposes to Amane, a member of his fan club, on a date, but is rejected.\nThe reason is \"because he's my oshi.\" Huh? Doesn't \"oshi\" mean \"to like\" something?\nUnable to accept this, Tenma devises a plan (a charade) to get Amane to notice him."
  },
